    "title": "Monument Dentist's License Suspended Over Nine Infection-Control Failures - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ethan Morgan ,\n21 hours ago 15854 Jackson Creek Pkwy. #140A — Site of Infection-Control Inspection. A Monument dentist has lost his license to practice after state regulators found nine separate infection-control failures at his office, along with medspa treatments they say fell well outside what his dental license allowed. The Colorado Dental Board suspended Dr. Scott Hirsbrunner’s license effective Sept. 11, determining that emergency action was necessary to protect public health, safety and welfare. Read full article",
